    <briefdescription>
<para>Voltage feedback helper functions for FB_VOLTAGE1 and FB_VOLTAGE2. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>FB_VOLTAGE1 (0x0203) contains VIO and VDD measurements (22-bit reply frame):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>VIO: bits [10:0] (11 bits) - Formula: V_IO = 0.0034534 V × &lt;VIO&gt;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>VDD: bits [21:11] (11 bits) - Formula: V_DD = 0.0034534 V × &lt;VDD&gt;</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>FB_VOLTAGE2 (0x0204) contains VBAT and temperature (22-bit reply frame):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>VBAT: bits [21:11] (11 bits) - Formula: V_BAT = 41.47 V × &lt;VBAT&gt;/(2^11-1) = 41.47 V × &lt;VBAT&gt;/2047</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TEMP_VALUE: bits [10:0] (11 bits) - Temperature feedback</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>These registers return 22-bit reply frames, so the full 22-bit value must be extracted. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
